        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>PDQ Rim Cylinder Lock</b>\r\n<p>\r\nCommercial door rim cylinder lock. Rim cylinders are normally used on the doors exterior to unlatch <a href=\"/collections/panic-devices\"><b>Rim Panic Devices</b></a>.  For for use with <a href=\"/products/grade-1-polished-brass-vertical-rod-exit-device-pdq-4200v-b605\"><b>PDQ-4200V-B605</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/grade-1-polished-brass-rim-exit-device-pdq-4200r-b605\"><b>PDQ-4200R-B605</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/grade-1-polished-brass-exit-device-for-38-48-inch-door-pdq-4200r-a605\"><b>PDQ-4200R-A605</b></a>. Available in Polished Brass, Brushed Chrome or Dark Bronze finish.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nCan be used on other door hardware items that use a rim cylinder lock. Normal bore hole in door is 1-1/4\" (32 mm). \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications:</b> for PDQ Rim Cylinder\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Cylinder Body Diameter: 1-9/64\" (1.140)</li>\r\n<li>Function: Keyed Rim Cylinder</li>\r\n<li>Standard 6-pin Schlage \"C\" Keyway</li>\r\n<li>Flat \"cut to size\" horizontal tail piece</li>\r\n<li>For up to 2-3/4\" thick doors</li>\r\n<li>Packed with 1-7/8\" diameter trim ring</li>\r\n<li>Includes mounting plate and two (2) #12 x 2-1/4\" machine screws</li>\r\n<!-- <li>Finish: Polished Brass</li> -->\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<br>",
